  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Village Bell Recipe 是一款讓遊戲中的鐘可合成的模組。當其他模組需要此物品，或你想用它們裝飾基地卻找不到村莊時非常實用。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/description.svg\" alt=\"說明\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合成配方使用 4 個石塊、任意原木 3 個以及 1 個金塊：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/village-bell-recipe/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"556\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">合成結果為：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/village-bell-recipe/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"632\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">懸掛狀態：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/village-bell-recipe/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"646\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 存放庫</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
